    <li><span style="color:var(--warning);">3</span>. <span style="color:var(--success);">[[Austenite]]</span> (γ‑Fe) has a face‑centered cubic (FCC) lattice and dissolves up to <span style="color:var(--warning);">2.0 %</span> carbon at <span style="color:var(--warning);">1147 °C</span>.</li>
